/E (Ideal for accountants, auditors, finance professionals, and business managers, the programme provides a strong foundation in the International Financial Reporting Standards \(IFRS\) framework and their application in preparing and interpreting financial statements. It serves as an excellent starting point for professionals who require a practical understanding of IFRS before progressing to advanced qualifications such as the Diploma in International Financial Reporting \(DipIFR\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
